northstar (1.0.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: real audio and video media elements, incremental
    repainting and cached text measurement, Encoding Standard decoders and
    encoders, Ed448/X448 in WebCrypto, stricter cross-origin frame and
    image isolation, dialog and popover per the HTML standard, and grid,
    table, flexbox and cascade fixes.

 -- Andreas Røsdal <andreas.rosdal@gmail.com>  Sat, 26 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200

